  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - SAWACO ICT STRATEGY AND IMPLEMENTATION PLAN, through Government of Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $593,660 technical assistance grant funds ICT implementation plan development for the Saigon Water Corporation (SAWACO). The assistance will help SAWACO improve its ICT systems and practices to enhance management and operational efficiency in the Ho Chi Minh City water supply system in Vietnam. This project is expected to serve as a model for broader application throughout Vietnam&apos;s water ICT sector.</narrative>
  </description>
